      "description": "A typeFilter section drops an excluded entry by the promoting removal. In Mixed the other-type entry 'Section note' (depth 1) has descendants Beta, Gamma and Theta; its removal lowers them by one, and the filtered anchor entry's removal lowers every deeper entry by one more, so Alpha, Beta and Delta render at level 3.",
